<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your JACOB data export is ready</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; background: #f9f9f9; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px; }
    .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    p { line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 8px 0 16px; }
    .url { word-break: break-all; font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #4b5563; background: #f3f4f6; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .callout { background: #fef9c3; border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="logo">JACOB</div>
    <p>Hi {{ display_name }},</p>
    <p>
      Your JACOB data export is ready to download. The bundle is a single
      <code>.json.gz</code> file containing your profile, messages, mentions,
      reactions, group memberships, mute and block lists, and audit history.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="button" href="{{ download_url }}">Download my data</a>
    </p>
    <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
    <p class="url">{{ download_url }}</p>
    <div class="callout">
      <strong>This link is sensitive.</strong> Anyone who has it can download
      your bundle. Don't forward this email. The link expires on
      <strong>{{ expires_at }}</strong>; after that, request a fresh export
      from your account settings.
    </div>
    <p>
      If you didn't request an export, please sign in and review your account
      activity, then contact us right away.
    </p>
    <p>— The JACOB team</p>
    <div class="footer">
      You received this email because a data export was requested for your JACOB account.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
